{'symbol': 'NOC', 'date': '2023-05-18 09:30:00', 'title': "NORTHROP GRUMMAN TO PARTICIPATE IN BERNSTEIN'S 39TH ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE", 'text': "FALLS CHURCH, VA., MAY 18, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION (NYSE: NOC) WILL PARTICIPATE IN BERNSTEIN'S 39TH ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE ON THURSDAY, JUNE 1. KATHY WARDEN, CHAIR, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND PRESIDENT, AND DAVE KEFFER, CORPORATE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, WILL PRESENT BEGINNING AT 9:00 A.M. EASTERN TIME. THE PRESENTATION WILL BE WEBCAST LIVE AT HTTP://INVESTOR.NORTHROPGRUMMAN.COM ."}